---
/**
 * About.astro - short, art-focused. Only location reference is Louisiana.
 * No em dashes anywhere.
 */
---

<section id="about" class="section about">
  <div class="reveal">
    <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Bright Against the Dark</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="about-body reveal">
    <p>
      Bee Magical paints bright, fae-touched creatures and the wild things they live
      among. Every piece is built to glow: loud color held against a deep, quiet night.
    </p>
    <p>
      Originals are one of a kind. Many are also offered as prints so a little of that
      light can hang anywhere. New work lands in its own small constellation as it is finished.
    </p>
    <p class="made">Made in Louisiana.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-body { max-width: 720px; margin: 28px auto 0; text-align: center; }
  .about-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(17px, 2.1vw, 20px);
    color: rgba(226, 232, 244, 0.82);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .about-body .made {
    font-family: var(--font-head);
    font-size: clamp(20px, 3vw, 28px);
    color: var(--gold);
    text-shadow: 0 0 22px rgba(233, 196, 106, 0.3);
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
</style>
